SUMMARY:Drop the mask and let your true monster out!
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\nIt's a Halloween Party so hol
 d the Date!\n\nParty Details\n\n* **Theme**: Unmask your hidden self.\n* *
 *Vibe**: Grown-up drinks\, killer costumes\, and zero filters.\n\n**Drop t
 he mask and let your true monster out to play this Halloween.**\n\nEvery d
 ay we wear the mask of the professional\, the polite\, and the responsible
 . Not tonight. This Halloween\, it’s time to shed your civilized skin an
 d unleash your **real personality**—no filters\, no judgements\, just pu
 re\, unadulterated fun.\nCome as who you *actually* are on the inside.\n
 🖤 The Ritual\n\n* **Date:** Saturday\, October 31st\, 2026\n* **Time:**
  7:00 PM until the spirits fade\n* **Lair: We are just confirming the venu
 e. We will keep you posted!**\n\n🍷 The Elements\n\n* **Potions & Brews:
 ** Drinks and nibbles provided!\n* **Attire:** Costumes required. Dress as
  your inner alter-ego\, your deepest obsession\, or the version of you tha
 t only comes out after dark.\n* **The Vibe:** Dark beats\, heavy pours\, a
 nd wicked company.\nADMISSION IS $20\,\n\nAre you brave enough to show you
 r true colours?\n\n***
